<title>UKRAINE: Hryvnia unchanged at 1.8450 per dlr in Kiev.</title>
<headline>Hryvnia unchanged at 1.8450 per dlr in Kiev.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
